          "text": "COUNT(*) counts every input row regardless of nulls. COUNT(expression) counts only the rows where that expression is not null. The orders table has 13 rows but two have a NULL delivery_time_minutes — so COUNT(*) returns 13 while COUNT(delivery_time_minutes) returns 11.",
