      "eyebrow": "Let's revisit",
      "title": "SUM, AVG, MIN and MAX — which question each answers",
      "lede": "Each function answers a different kind of question about a set of values.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "SUM totals the non-null values — use it for 'what is the combined amount'. AVG computes the arithmetic mean — use it for 'what is the typical value'. MIN finds the smallest non-null value — use it for 'what is the fastest delivery'. MAX finds the largest — use it for 'what is the slowest delivery'. All four skip NULLs.",
